<main class="min-h-screen bg-white text-neutral-900 font-sans selection:bg-blue-100 selection:text-blue-900 pb-32"><div class="pt-24 lg:pt-32"></div><section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 mb-24 lg:mb-32"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-24"><div class="flex-1 text-center lg:text-left"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase border border-neutral-200">About Me</span><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-serif leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6 text-neutral-900">Hi, I'm Kush Agrawal</h1><p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-neutral-500 font-medium tracking-tight mb-8 leading-snug">A passionate developer, technical author, and lifelong learner.</p><p class="text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">I am a B.Tech Computer Science student specializing in crafting intelligent, high-performance web applications and systems. My work spans across Full Stack Development, Data Analytics, AI &amp; Automation, and Technical Writing. I believe in solving real-world problems through clean code and effective communication.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4"><a class="flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-700 font-medium hover:bg-neutral-50 hover:shadow-sm transition-all duration-300" href="https://github.com/Kushagrawal1903" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg fill="currentColor" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.