bg-neutral-100 shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] border border-neutral-100 transform transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"><img alt="Kush Agrawal Portrait" class="object-cover object-top" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" src="/images/kusha.png" srcset="/images/kusha.png 384w, /images/kusha.png 640w, /images/kusha.png 750w, /images/kusha.png 828w, /images/kusha.png 1080w, /images/kusha.png 1200w, /images/kusha.png 1920w, /images/kusha.png 2048w, /images/kusha.png 3840w" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-50 rounded-full blur-2xl -z-10"></div><div class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 w-32 h-32 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full blur-2xl -z-10"></div></div></div></section><section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 mb-24 lg:mb-32"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-900 mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">B.Tech</div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Computer Science</div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-900 mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">4</div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Books Published</div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-900 mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform leading-tight">Cybersecurity</div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Internship Exp.</div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-900 mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform leading-tight">Full Stack</div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Data • AI</div></div></div></section><div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 mb-24 lg:mb-32"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24"><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif mb-10 text-neutral-900">My Engineering Journey</h2><div class="relative border-l border-neutral-200 ml-3 md:ml-4 space-y-12 pb-4"><div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-10"><div class="absolute -left-3.5 md:-left-[15px] top-1 w-7 h-7 bg-white border-2 border-neutral-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-neutral-400 rounded-full"></div></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Curiosity Spark</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">My journey started with a fascination for how software can scale and impact thousands of users, driving me to understand the core mechanics of computing.</p></div><div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-10"><div class="absolute -left-3.5 md:-left-[15px] top-1 w-7 h-7 bg-white border-2 border-neutral-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-neutral-500 rounded-full"></div></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Started Building</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">I immersed myself in the JavaScript and Python ecosystems, building responsive front-ends with React and Next.js, and robust backends with Node.js.</p></div><div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-10"><div class="absolute -left-3.5 md:-left-[15px] top-1 w-7 h-7 bg-white border-2 border-neutral-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-neutral-700 rounded-full"></div></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Exploration &amp; Growth</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Beyond web development, I expanded into Data Analytics and Cybersecurity, understanding how to secure systems and extract insights from raw data.</p></div><div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-10"><div class="absolute -left-3.5 md:-left-[15px] top-1 w-7 h-7 bg-white border-2 border-neutral-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-neutral-900 rounded-full"></div></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Current Focus</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">I am currently refining my ability to architect complex state management, optimize rendering performance, and integrate generative AI into web platforms.</p></div><div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-10"><div class="absolute -left-3.5 md:-left-[15px] top-1 w-7 h-7 bg-white border-2 border-blue-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Future Vision</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">My goal is to dive deeper into large-scale distributed systems and advanced machine learning integrations to build next-generation user experiences.</p></div></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif mb-10 text-neutral-900">What Drives Me</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-5 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors"><svg class="text-neutral-700" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="16" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="8" y2="8"></line></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Problem Solving</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Tackling complex logic challenges and optimizing algorithms to create elegant, efficient, and scalable technical solutions.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-5 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors"><svg class="text-neutral-700" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Continuous Learning</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Staying at the forefront of technology by constantly exploring new frameworks, languages, and architectural paradigms.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-5 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors"><svg class="text-neutral-700" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Sharing Knowledge</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Breaking down intricate technical concepts into digestible materials to empower and educate the developer community.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-5 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors"><svg class="text-neutral-700" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Building Impactful Products</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Developing software that goes beyond code to deliver real value, seamless user experiences, and measurable positive impact.</p></div></div></div></section></div></div><section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 mb-24 lg:mb-32"><div class="bg-neutral-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 border border-neutral-100"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 rounded-full bg-white text-neutral-600 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase border border-neutral-200">Technical Author</span><h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-serif mb-6 text-neutral-900">Writing &amp; Publications</h2><p class="text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">I firmly believe that the best way to master a subject is to teach it. My educational philosophy centers on breaking down complex architectural patterns and programming paradigms into structured, digestible concepts for university students.</p><p class="text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">Through Guru-Shishya Publication, I have authored comprehensive technical textbooks aimed at bridging the gap between theoretical models and practical implementation.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8"><div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="text-neutral-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm leading-tight">Fundamentals of IoT</h4></div><div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="text-neutral-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm leading-tight">Computer Architecture</h4></div><div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="text-neutral-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm leading-tight">Basic Programming with C</h4></div><div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="text-neutral-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm leading-tight">Concepts of OOP</h4></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-900 font-semibold hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors group" href="/books">View Publications<span class="transform transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></a></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 w-full"><div class="relative group"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white p-3.5 shadow-[0_15px_35px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-neutral-200 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-100"><img alt="Felicitation at Academic Award Ceremony" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-102" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw" src="/images/felicitation.jpg" srcset="/images/felicitation.jpg 256w, /images/felicitation.jpg 384w, /images/felic